# Chats, on Groups as it is: a person keeps only the messages they receive.

SCREEN Chats ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST Groups: "Alice is a member of the group Hikers of Bob" OPENS Group
    LIST Contacts: EVERYONE WITH knows, friend OPENS Chat
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Create: Alice may create Hikers, Hikers TYPED
    Close: Alice may close Hikers by leaving it, Hikers FROM leader

SCREEN Chat ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, friend
    THREAD: message
    Befriend: Alice and Bob may jointly become friends
    Unfriend: Alice may end her friendship with Bob
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Carol FROM knows
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Bob to Carol, Carol FROM knows
    Join: Alice may add Bob to Hikers, Hikers FROM leader
    Remove: Alice may end Bob's membership in Hikers, Hikers FROM listed
    Message: Alice may send Text to Bob, Text TYPED

SCREEN Group ABOUT "Alice is a member of the group Hikers of Bob":
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW: member, leader, listed, posted, group_delivered
    THREAD: group_message
    Leave: Alice may end her membership in Bob's Hikers
    Post: Alice may send Text to the group Hikers of Bob, Text TYPED
    Post own: Alice may send Text to the group Hikers of Alice, Text TYPED
